{"seq":2,"slug":"refurbish-repack-relabel","title":"翻新/重新包装/换标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/inspect-grade-refurbish/refurbish-repack-relabel","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"翻新-重新包装-换标\">翻新/重新包装/换标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>质检给出的结论是「这件是 B 级、外观有轻微痕迹、功能完好、缺原包装」。从结论到一件可以重新上架的商品，中间还有一段作业：修复可修复的缺陷、补齐缺失的配件与包装、以及重做标签。这一段作业的产出物是 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/central-inspection-grade\">3.1</a> 里那个 <code>as_shipped_grade</code> 字段，而它的成本直接决定 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel\">3.3 分级降级与渠道分流</a> 里这件货的毛利是否为正。</p>\n<p>翻新作业有一个反直觉的性质：<strong>它的成本几乎全是变动成本，而它的收益是概率性的</strong>。修复工序的每一分钟人工、每一个替换件都是确定支出，而修复后能否真的卖到更高价格，取决于市场对那个等级的接受度。所以翻新工序的设计目标不是「修得最好」，而是<strong>在给定的成本上限内，把等级推到最划算的那一档</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三道工序及其成本结构\">三道工序及其成本结构</h2><h3 id=\"清洁与外观修复\">清洁与外观修复</h3><p>成本最低、收益最直接的一道。擦拭、去污、抛光、换贴膜这类作业的单位成本通常只有几分钟人工，但足以把一件「明显用过」的货变成「看起来接近全新」。因此它是<strong>性价比最高的工序</strong>，应当默认执行。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工序</th>\n<th>典型单位成本量级</th>\n<th>能提升的等级</th>\n<th>适用前提</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>清洁与外观修复</td>\n<td>最低（分钟级人工）</td>\n<td>C → B，B → A</td>\n<td>无功能性缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配件补齐</td>\n<td>中（配件成本 + 人工）</td>\n<td>B → A（若包装与配件是唯一差距）</td>\n<td>配件可获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部件更换</td>\n<td>高（部件成本 + 工时）</td>\n<td>D → B/C，C → B</td>\n<td>部件可获取且工时可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上表的量级差异是数量级级别的，因此<strong>工序的尝试顺序必须是从上到下</strong>：先做最便宜的清洁，再看还差什么，再决定是否补配件，最后才考虑换件。反过来做（先换件再清洁）会在很多本可低成本解决的件上浪费部件成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配件补齐与包装重建\">配件补齐与包装重建</h3><p>配件补齐看起来简单，实际是翻新作业里最难的环节，因为<strong>配件本身的来源是逆向的</strong>。原包装和配件通常随退货一起回来，但往往已经破损或缺失；从新品库存里拆配件会侵蚀新品毛利；从其它退货件里拆配件需要一个「拆件池」——而拆件池的存货管理，本质上就是 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/defect-destroy-secondary\">4.2 残次销毁/二手转售处置</a> 里 D 级件拆件流程的上游。</p>\n<p>工程上的含义是，配件需求应该被<strong>聚合而不是逐单处理</strong>：把一段时间内所有「缺同一配件」的件归集起来，凑够一定数量再去采购或拆件，否则每个件都单独采购一个配件，管理成本会超过配件本身的价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重新包装\">重新包装</h3><p>重新包装不是把货塞进一个通用纸箱。它至少包含三层信息的一致性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[翻新完成的货] --&gt; B[内包装&lt;br/&gt;保护 + 配件归位]&#10;  B --&gt; C[外包装&lt;br/&gt;规格与新品一致或明确标注]&#10;  C --&gt; D[标签体系]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[商品标签&lt;br/&gt;GTIN]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[序列号标签&lt;br/&gt;与实物一致]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[合规标识&lt;br/&gt;CE/能效/电池 QR]&#10;  D --&gt; D4[等级标识&lt;br/&gt;开箱/翻新声明]&#10;  D1 --&gt; E[入库待售]&#10;  D2 --&gt; E&#10;  D3 --&gt; E&#10;  D4 --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[翻新完成的货] --&gt; B[内包装&lt;br/&gt;保护 + 配件归位]\n  B --&gt; C[外包装&lt;br/&gt;规格与新品一致或明确标注]\n  C --&gt; D[标签体系]\n  D --&gt; D1[商品标签&lt;br/&gt;GTIN]\n  D --&gt; D2[序列号标签&lt;br/&gt;与实物一致]\n  D --&gt; D3[合规标识&lt;br/&gt;CE/能效/电池 QR]\n  D --&gt; D4[等级标识&lt;br/&gt;开箱/翻新声明]\n  D1 --&gt; E[入库待售]\n  D2 --&gt; E\n  D3 --&gt; E\n  D4 --&gt; E</pre><p>四类标签里，前两类是<strong>一致性</strong>问题，后两类是<strong>合规性</strong>问题，处理难度完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"包装规格的一致性约束\">包装规格的一致性约束</h3><p>外包装还有一条容易被忽略的约束：<strong>它必须与商品的在售规格一致，或者明确标注差异</strong>。把翻新件装进一个尺寸或外观与新品明显不同的箱子里，会在买家侧制造认知落差——买家按「开箱品」下单，收到的却是一个印着翻新标签的素箱，这种落差本身就是退货率的来源，而每产生一次退货，这件货就要重新走一遍本 hub 的全部流程。因此包装模板通常按「同规格、不同声明」的方式管理：箱型与新品一致，标签区表达等级与来源。这条纪律与 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel\">3.3 分级降级与渠道分流</a> 的渠道承诺直接关联——渠道承诺了什么等级，包装与标识就必须与之匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标签重打的规则边界\">标签重打的规则边界</h2><p>这是翻新作业里最容易被工程团队低估的部分。它涉及到三类标签，每类的重打规则不一样。</p>\n<h3 id=\"商品与序列号标签\">商品与序列号标签</h3><p>商品标签（GTIN）与序列号标签必须与实物严格对应，且<strong>必须能追溯到质检记录</strong>。GS1 的应用标识符体系为此提供了标准容器：AI (01) 承载 GTIN、AI (21) 承载序列号、AI (10) 承载批次（见 <a href=\"https://ref.gs1.org/ai/\">GS1 Application Identifiers</a>）。重打标签时的核心纪律是：<strong>序列号来自实物，而不是来自数据库中的原订单</strong>。这两者本应一致，但因为 <a href=\"../return-consolidate-overseas/overseas-return-center-warehouse\">1.1</a> 强调的身份绑定可能失败，重打标签必须做一次实物核验，而不是直接复制原订单的序列号——否则会把一件 A 商品的标签贴到 B 商品上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合规标识\">合规标识</h3><p>合规标识不能简单照抄，因为<strong>它们与产品状态绑定</strong>。三类典型情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CE 标志等市场准入标识</strong>：制造商通过符合性评估获得，加贴在合法上市的合规产品上（见 <a href=\"https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/single-market/ce-marking_en\">EU CE marking</a>）。翻新后的产品如果更换了核心部件，其符合性主张本身可能需要重新评估，而不是简单重贴一个标。</li>\n<li><strong>能效标识</strong>：某些市场的能效标识与产品型号绑定，翻新件应保留原标识，不应重新打印一份新的。</li>\n<li><strong>电池相关标识</strong>：欧盟《电池法规》(EU) 2023/1542 对电池的可持续性、标识与循环利用提出要求并分阶段适用（见 <a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/batteries_en\">European Commission, Batteries</a>），涉及电池的翻新件在标识上需要格外谨慎。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上的做法是：<strong>把「合规标识是否仍有效」设成翻新作业的一个检查项</strong>，答案不是自动为真。如果无法确认，该件应降级到不依赖该标识的渠道（通常就是 3.3 里的尾货或 B2B 渠道，那里不面向需要合规标识的终端消费者）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"等级与来源声明标识\">等级与来源声明标识</h3><p>翻新件在多数市场不应以「新品」形态出售，因此需要一个明确的等级/来源声明。这项标识重打的自由度最大（因为它是自有的），但要求也最严：<strong>它必须准确</strong>。把 B 级件标成 A 级，短期能卖高价，长期会产生大量退货——而这些退货又会回到这条链路的起点，形成成本循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"翻新作业单\">翻新作业单</h2><p>翻新作业的每一道工序都要落成记录，因为它是成本归集的依据，也是 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/restockable-return-inventory\">4.1</a> 里再售品成本基准的来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;refurb_job_id&quot;: 55120,&#10;  &quot;rma_id&quot;: 88213374,&#10;  &quot;serial_no&quot;: &quot;SN-8F2A-0091377&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grade_in&quot;: &quot;C&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grade_out_target&quot;: &quot;B&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grade_out_actual&quot;: &quot;B&quot;,&#10;  &quot;operations&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;CLEAN_COSMETIC&quot;, &quot;minutes&quot;: 6, &quot;parts_cost&quot;: 0.0 },&#10;    { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;SCREEN_POLISH&quot;, &quot;minutes&quot;: 4, &quot;parts_cost&quot;: 0.4 },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;op&quot;: &quot;ACCESSORY_FILL&quot;,&#10;      &quot;minutes&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;parts_cost&quot;: 3.1,&#10;      &quot;parts&quot;: [{ &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;ACC-USB-C-1M&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 1, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;HARVEST_POOL&quot; }]&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;label_actions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;SERIAL&quot;, &quot;verified_against&quot;: &quot;PHYSICAL_SCAN&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;COMPLIANCE&quot;, &quot;result&quot;: &quot;RETAINED_ORIGINAL&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;no core part swap&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;GRADE_DISCLOSURE&quot;, &quot;grade&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;label_template&quot;: &quot;OPENBOX_ZH_2026&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;total_minutes&quot;: 12,&#10;  &quot;total_parts_cost&quot;: 3.5,&#10;  &quot;cost_basis_delta&quot;: 4.82&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"refurb_job_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rma_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88213374</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"serial_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SN-8F2A-0091377\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grade_in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grade_out_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grade_out_actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"operations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CLEAN_COSMETIC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"parts_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SCREEN_POLISH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"parts_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACCESSORY_FILL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"parts_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"parts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACC-USB-C-1M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HARVEST_POOL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"label_actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SERIAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"verified_against\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PHYSICAL_SCAN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"COMPLIANCE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RETAINED_ORIGINAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no core part swap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GRADE_DISCLOSURE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"grade\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label_template\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OPENBOX_ZH_2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_minutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_parts_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cost_basis_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.82</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cost_basis_delta</code> 是这次翻新对商品成本基准的增量，它会累加到该件的库存成本上（见 4.1）。把这个字段显式记录下来，才能回答「这个批次翻新花了多少钱、带来多少等级提升」——而这正是评估翻新工序是否值得的执行依据。<code>label_actions</code> 里 <code>COMPLIANCE</code> 的 <code>result</code> 取值设计成 <code>RETAINED_ORIGINAL</code> / <code>REPRINTED</code> / <code>REMOVED</code> 三态，正是为了让「合规标识是否被动过」成为一个可查询事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个成本上限规则\">一个成本上限规则</h2><p>翻新工序必须有一条硬性的成本上限规则，否则会陷入「越修越亏」的循环：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{refurb} \\le \\alpha \\cdot \\left(V_{target} - V_{current}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标等级的市场可实现价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{current}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当前等级的可实现价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全系数（显著小于 1，用于覆盖销售周期与渠道费用）。当预计修复成本超过这条线时，正确的动作是停止修复并让该件留在当前等级——<strong>这条规则应该做成系统里的一个拦截，而不是翻新工位的自觉</strong>，因为工位天然倾向于「既然拆开了就一起修了吧」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻篇的衔接\">与相邻篇的衔接</h2><p>本篇把 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/central-inspection-grade\">3.1</a> 的 <code>as_shipped_grade</code> 变成事实；它的作业工序与 <a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/bonded-repair-reprocess\">2.2 保税维修/再加工模式</a> 里的维修工序高度重叠，差别只在监管环境（保税区内的作业要额外满足账册与核销要求）。本篇的修复成本与配件来源依赖 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/defect-destroy-secondary\">4.2</a> 的拆件池，产出物的定价与去向由 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel\">3.3 分级降级与渠道分流</a> 决定，成本基准的累加落在 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/restockable-return-inventory\">4.1</a>。合规标识所依赖的商品标识体系见 120_gtin-product-identity-masterdata。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>翻新作业的成本几乎全是确定的变动成本，收益却是概率性的；目标是「在成本上限内把等级推到最划算的一档」，不是「修得最好」。</li>\n<li>工序顺序必须从最便宜的清洁开始，再补配件，最后才换件；顺序颠倒会在本可低成本解决的件上浪费部件成本。</li>\n<li>配件补齐要聚合需求、共享拆件池，逐单采购的管理成本会超过配件价值。</li>\n<li>序列号标签必须来自实物扫描核验，不能直接复制原订单数据。</li>\n<li>合规标识不能照抄：CE 类标识涉及符合性主张，能效标识与型号绑定，电池标识受 (EU) 2023/1542 约束；无法确认有效性的件应降级到不依赖它的渠道。</li>\n<li>翻新工序必须有显式成本上限规则并做成系统拦截，防止「拆开了就一起修」的亏本循环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"翻新/重新包装/换标","id":"翻新-重新包装-换标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三道工序及其成本结构","id":"三道工序及其成本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"清洁与外观修复","id":"清洁与外观修复"},{"level":3,"text":"配件补齐与包装重建","id":"配件补齐与包装重建"},{"level":3,"text":"重新包装","id":"重新包装"},{"level":3,"text":"包装规格的一致性约束","id":"包装规格的一致性约束"},{"level":2,"text":"标签重打的规则边界","id":"标签重打的规则边界"},{"level":3,"text":"商品与序列号标签","id":"商品与序列号标签"},{"level":3,"text":"合规标识","id":"合规标识"},{"level":3,"text":"等级与来源声明标识","id":"等级与来源声明标识"},{"level":2,"text":"翻新作业单","id":"翻新作业单"},{"level":2,"text":"一个成本上限规则","id":"一个成本上限规则"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻篇的衔接","id":"与相邻篇的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集中质检与分级标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/inspect-grade-refurbish/central-inspection-grade"},"next":{"title":"分级降级与渠道分流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel"}}